        "text": "Kelly M. Cassidy has represented the 14th District in the Illinois House since May 2011. She chairs the House Committee on Restorative Justice and serves on the Ethics and Elections committee. She was legislative director for the Chicago office of the National Organization for Women and managed grant programs for the Cook County State’s Attorney.",
